-- More Hanukkah products from the supplier (Art Judaica), 53 products:
-- single items for the custom gift box: trays, menorah houses, blessing cards,
-- oil jugs, oil cups, shamash wands and
-- dreidels, in Hebrew, French and English. Some are wholesale packs (e.g. 12
-- dreidels): the name says so.
-- Like db/import-art-hanukkah.sql: they come in HIDDEN with no price, ids are
