   'An elegant wall-mounted menorah house with a frame of elegant copper-tone aluminium and quality clear glass. A metal roof protects from wind and rain and allows candles to be lit safely outdoors. A luxurious design combining function and beauty, perfect for the entrance of the home at Hanukkah.',
